  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_11
    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_11
    value: "<size=16>SCATTERS trigger \nfeature in any position."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=16>WILDS substitute for all symbols, except \nSCATTERS. When one
      or more WILDS\nsubstitute in a win, highest win is paid."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=42>FEATURE</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: '<size=18>3 SCATTERS on reels 2, 3, and 4 trigger the Pick and Spin Feature.


      Player will pick from 15 different crystal hearts. Players will be awarded free
      spins for each pick.


      If "Collected" is selected 1st, the player will "Win All" unrevealed crystal
      hearts (the 14 unpicked ones).

      If "Collected" is selected as the 2nd or later pick, the player will be awarded
      all previously selected

      free spins plus 5 free spins.


      Finding the "Collect" will end the feature and accumulated free spins are played.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: '<size=16>After Pick feature is complete, player will play the awarded
      spins.


      The game screen will transition into the Free Spin screen

      with Desert Rose symbols on top of each reel.


      During each Free Spin, Crystal Hearts may appear on the symbols,

      to be collected on top of the reels in associated symbol boxes.


      Once 3 Crystal Hearts are collected for a reel, that reel will be

      activated for all remaining free spins.


      Any Wild landing on an activated reel will expand to replace all

      symbols on that reel.


      The feature cannot be re-triggered.


      Coins bet and lines played are the same as the game that triggered

      the pick and spin feature.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>25 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Desert Rose
